@EirService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:6000

### Create a help request. Eir creates a student cookie if one is missing.
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/createhelprequest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "request-2",
  "message": "Direct Eir help request"
}

### Create a session without a bearer token. Expected: 401 Unauthorized.
POST {{EirService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/createsession
